    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Besmirch </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hired to work a farm in Besmirch. Tend the crops for a greedy owner and a starving town.\u00a0To make things worse, there are rumors of apocalypse. Stock up and Survive the gates of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/24b02c8ad247bb70a8028a17f792ed08.poster.avif?t=1745916534\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/24b02c8ad247bb70a8028a17f792ed08.webm?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/24b02c8ad247bb70a8028a17f792ed08.mp4?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hide or fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealthily hide in the bushes or go in guns blazing, managing this farm is far from safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/4ddc29eb9b61b43919c439eace13b7fa.poster.avif?t=1745916534\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/4ddc29eb9b61b43919c439eace13b7fa.webm?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/4ddc29eb9b61b43919c439eace13b7fa.mp4?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Socialize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gossip and tall tales are normal in conversations. Who can you trust and how can you befriend the town while keeping your conscience clean?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/26d88d7a91a648adb9ec2cbe6af69d7d.poster.avif?t=1745916534\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/26d88d7a91a648adb9ec2cbe6af69d7d.webm?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/26d88d7a91a648adb9ec2cbe6af69d7d.mp4?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark tunnels lead to hidden pasts. Crawl through dungeons and caves to find treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/f8ff7c9959cbeebbe4c43c09739cf08d.poster.avif?t=1745916534\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/f8ff7c9959cbeebbe4c43c09739cf08d.webm?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/f8ff7c9959cbeebbe4c43c09739cf08d.mp4?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft and Cook</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food is scarce, the town is in need. A good meal can go a long way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/a32cf2d5854bc1b6d07d2084501335fa.poster.avif?t=1745916534\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/a32cf2d5854bc1b6d07d2084501335fa.webm?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/a32cf2d5854bc1b6d07d2084501335fa.mp4?t=1745916534\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xbox Controller support. Mouse and Keyboard may be needed occasionally.</strong></p>",
